## https://yazi-rs.github.io/docs/quick-start/#keybindings
yazi: (Navigation) Move the cursor up/down                                       | k/j / Up/Dn
yazi: (Navigation) Enter hovered directory                                       | l/Rt
yazi: (Navigation) Leave the current directory                                   | h/Lt
yazi: (Navigation) Seek up/down 5 units in the preview                           | K/J
yazi: (Navigation) Move cursor to the top/bottom                                 | gg/G
yazi: (Selection) Toggle selection of hovered file/directory                     | Spc
yazi: (Selection) Enter visual mode (selection mode)                             | v
yazi: (Selection) Enter visual mode (unset mode)                                 | V
yazi: (Selection) Select all files                                               | C-a
yazi: (Selection) Inverse selection of all files                                 | C-r
yazi: (Selection) Cancel selection                                               | Esc
yazi: (File operations) Open selected files                                      | o/Etr
yazi: (File operations) Open selected files interactively                        | O/S-Etr
yazi: (File operations) Show the file information                                | Tab
yazi: (File operations) Yank selected files (copy)                               | y
yazi: (File operations) Yank selected files (cut)                                | x
yazi: (File operations) Paste yanked files                                       | p
yazi: (File operations) Paste yanked files (overwrite if the destination exists) | P
yazi: (File operations) Cancel the yank status                                   | Y/X
yazi: (File operations) Trash selected files                                     | d
yazi: (File operations) Permanently delete selected files                        | D
yazi: (File operations) Create a file (ends with / for directories)              | a
yazi: (File operations) Rename selected file(s)                                  | r
yazi: (File operations) Toggle the visibility of hidden files                    | .
yazi: (File operations) Run a shell command                                      | ;
yazi: (File operations) Run a shell command (block until finishes)               | :
yazi: (File operations) Symlink the absolute/relative path of yanked files       | -/_
yazi: (File operations) Hardlink yanked files                                    | C--
yazi: (Copy paths) Copy the file path                                            | cc
yazi: (Copy paths) Copy the directory path                                       | cd
yazi: (Copy paths) Copy the filename                                             | cf
yazi: (Copy paths) Copy the filename without extension                           | cn
yazi: (Filter files) Filter files                                                | f
yazi: (Find files) Find next/previous file                                       | //?
yazi: (Find files) Go to the next/previous found                                 | n/N
yazi: (Search files) Search files by name using fd                               | s
yazi: (Search files) Search files by content using ripgrep                       | S
yazi: (Search files) Cancel the ongoing search                                   | C-s
yazi: (Sorting) Sort by modified time/(reverse)                                  | ,m/,M
yazi: (Sorting) Sort by birth time/(reverse)                                     | ,b/,B
yazi: (Sorting) Sort by file extension/(reverse)                                 | ,e/,E
yazi: (Sorting) Sort alphabetically/(reverse)                                    | ,a/,A
yazi: (Sorting) Sort naturally/(reverse)                                         | ,n/,N
yazi: (Sorting) Sort by size/(reverse)                                           | ,s/,S
yazi: (Sorting) Sort randomly                                                    | ,r
yazi: (Multi-tab) Create a new tab with CWD                                      | t
yazi: (Multi-tab) Switch to the $-th tab                                         | $
yazi: (Multi-tab) Switch to the previous/next tab                                | [/]
yazi: (Multi-tab) Swap current tab with previous/next tab                        | {/}
yazi: (Multi-tab) Close the current tab                                          | C-c